<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/34/eng@/~cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 91u(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Subsections 6(2), (3), (4) and (5)” the words “Subsection 6(2)”. New Part XVe"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/34/eng@> .
